From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 17:08:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] S4-W step 1: the Prize Wheel's result card holds once its
 window has popped and the confetti is gone

A held tick repaints only the bulbs, the winning icon's light (the clean pie under it is
kept with the new plat_under) and the hub; 60 ms -> 3.5 ms a tick on the GBA, 15 -> 30 fps.
The disc outside the window is the same picture as the full frame's on all 220 ticks.

